  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arts &amp; crafts for migrant and indigenous children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With your support, this project can grant 400 children from hostile family environments access to cultural and educational workshops. Due to the current social violence crisis, child abuse in Oaxaca has increased by 300%, and many children now live in risky conditions and have no safe spaces. The Art &amp; Crafts School program promotes guidance and care for children. By participating, you can help give these children valuable experiences that will enrich their lives and broaden their horizons.</narrative>
  </description>
